/**
 * Bootstrap for FluentCart Pro's MCP additions.
 *
 * Wires the FluentHub auto-installer (so the "Install FluentHub" button in
 * FluentCart free can install the MCP adapter in one click when Pro is active)
 * and, when a Pro module that exposes MCP tools is enabled, pushes those tools
 * onto the free `fluent-cart` server via the documented extension seam:
 *   - `fluent_cart/mcp_loaded`        → register the abilities
 *   - `fluent_cart/mcp_ability_names` → expose them on the server
