namespace FluentCartPro\App\Modules\MCP\Tools;

/**
 * License tools (FluentCart Pro) — find software licenses, then load one fully.
 *
 * Read-only surface, registered only when the Licensing module is active (see
 * MCPInit). Reuses the free plugin's MCPHelper envelope/pagination/money and
 * the existing `licenses/view` capability, so the MCP user sees exactly what an
 * admin with that role sees in Settings → Licenses.
 *
 * Parameter design mirrors list-subscriptions: filter on what owners triage by
 * (status, product, customer) plus the expiry window — expiring_before is the
 * renewal-prevention lever ("which licenses lapse in the next 30 days?").
 *
 * Statuses are the stored values active|inactive|expired|disabled. "expiring"
 * is a computed display state (past expiration_date, not yet expired) and is
 * not a stored value — use expiring_before to find those.
 */
