     * seconds up to over an hour. The core scheduler retries every 5 minutes, waiting
     * at least ARB_RETRY_MIN_DELAY_SECONDS before the first attempt, up to
     * ARB_RETRY_MAX_ATTEMPTS attempts, then manual action required.
